=== SSH edge collector setup (one-time) ===
1. Add to your ~/.ssh/config (exactly once):
   Include ~/.config/mem/ssh-config

2. On collector (edgehost.otherdomain.com), append to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys:
   no-agent-forwarding,no-port-forwarding,no-pty,no-user-rc,no-X11-forwarding ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHtpmJxxk6Z5LpQkrwNa2YE3ZWkoRnAna6ZSQT3MRBUi mem@CabinInspiron22Kali

3. Public key file: /tmp/mem-live/s7/home/key2.pub
   (copy the ssh-ed25519 line above or cat it)
4. Test connectivity: ssh mem-edgehost "git --version"
5. Run: mem sync
